TITLE Mix river water (pH 6, Cl 10) and seawater (pH 8.1, Cl 19000) at 0.7:0.3
SOLUTION 1 River
    pH 6.0
    Cl 10
    -water 1
SOLUTION 2 Seawater
    pH 8.1
    Cl 19000
    -water 1
MIX 1
    1 0.7
    2 0.3
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings a_H+
10 PUNCH ACT("H+")
END
